{"speciesId":600,"names":{"fr":"Clic","es":"Klang","en":"Klang","ja":"ギギアル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ils communiquent entre eux en changeant leur sens de rotation. Plus ils sont en colère, plus ils tournent vite."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"By changing the direction in which it rotates, it communicates its feelings to others. When angry, it rotates faster."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il attaque en lançant ses mini-rouages à grande vitesse. Il est en fâcheuse posture s’ils ne reviennent pas."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Spinning minigears are rotated at high speed and repeatedly fired away. It is dangerous if the gears don’t return."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A minigear and big gear comprise its body. If the minigear it launches at a foe doesn’t return, it will die."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A minigear and big gear comprise its body. If the minigear it launches at a foe doesn’t return, it will die."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ils communiquent entre eux en changeant leur sens de rotation. Plus ils sont en colère, plus ils tournent vite."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Muestra sus sentimientos cambiando la dirección de su giro. Cuanto más se enfade, más rápido girará."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"By changing the direction in which it rotates, it communicates its feelings to others. When angry, it rotates faster."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"回転方向を 変える ことで 仲間に 気持ちを 伝えている。 怒るほど 回転が 速くなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Le plus grand des rouages projette le plus petit pour attaquer. Ce dernier risque de dépérir s’il ne revient pas."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se compone de una rueda dentada grande y otra pequeña. Lanza la pequeña para atacar, pero se debilita si no regresa."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"A minigear and big gear comprise its body. If the minigear it launches at a foe doesn’t return, it will die."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ちびギアと でかギアに わかれた。 攻撃のため 飛ばした ちびギアが 戻ってこないと 死んでしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ils communiquent entre eux en changeant leur sens de rotation. Plus ils sont en colère, plus ils tournent vite."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Muestra sus sentimientos cambiando la dirección de su giro. Cuanto más se enfade, más rápido girará."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"By changing the direction in which it rotates, it communicates its feelings to others. When angry, it rotates faster."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"回転方向を 変える ことで 仲間に 気持ちを 伝えている。 怒るほど 回転が 速くなる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Le plus grand des rouages projette le plus petit pour attaquer. Ce dernier risque de dépérir s’il ne revient pas."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Se compone de una rueda dentada grande y otra pequeña. Lanza la pequeña para atacar, pero se debilita si no regresa."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"A minigear and big gear comprise its body. If the minigear it launches at a foe doesn’t return, it will die."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ちびギアと でかギアに わかれた。 攻撃のため 飛ばした ちびギアが 戻ってこないと 死んでしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Quand le combat devient sérieux, la partie extérieure du grand rouage s’aligne parfaitement avec le petit pour accélérer leur rotation."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuando se pone en serio, la parte externa de la rueda dentada grande se acopla a la pequeña y aumenta su velocidad de rotación."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"When Klang goes all out, the minigear links up perfectly with the outer part of the big gear, and this Pokémon’s rotation speed increases sharply."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"本気の ときは でかギアの 外の 歯車と ちびギアが 合致。 回転速度が 飛躍 するのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon symbolisant la technologie industrielle est souvent utilisé dans le logo des entreprises de Galar."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Muchas empresas de Galar usan su imagen en sus logotipos como símbolo de tecnología industrial."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Many companies in the Galar region choose Klang as their logo. This Pokémon is considered the symbol of industrial technology."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"工業技術の シンボルとして 多くの ガラルの 会社で 企業ロゴに 採用 される。"}],"varieties":[{"id":600,"moves":[{"name":"vice-grip","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[11,"level-up",21],[14,"level-up",21],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",21],[16,"level-up",21],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",21],[18,"level-up",21],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[11,"level-up",64],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",64],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",64],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",64],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",64],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",64],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",54],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-shock","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",11],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",11],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",11],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",11],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",11],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",11],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"screech","learns":[[11,"level-up",40],[14,"level-up",40],[15,"level-up",40],[16,"level